<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῠθ-αίνω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύθηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.791
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				13.14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (v. infr.), etc.:—poet. and later Prose word for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθραίνω, ἐρεύθω,</span>
			<i>dye red,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα πέπλον ἐρύθηνεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.474
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύκει -ήνας χρόαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
				</span></i>
			 l.c. ; <i>make to blush,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.791
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dyed red,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθαίνετο αἵματι γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.484
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.21
			</span></i> : c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				11.92
			</span></i> (s.v.l.) ; <i>blush scarlet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				12.8
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, also in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.31.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.87
			</span></i>.</div>
